00:57:21.380 --> 00:57:26.950
<v Will Powers>How can I, the organization providing the service, please you?
<v Will Powers>作为提供服务的组织，我该如何取悦你？

00:57:26.950 --> 00:57:58.420
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass, back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯，下周回来带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

00:57:58.420 --> 00:58:03.420
